00:11:30,240 --> 00:11:34,240
is equal to the price of X times the amount of X

307
00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:36,600
that you start out with plus the price of Y

308
00:11:36,600 --> 00:11:39,040
times the amount of Y that you start out with.

309
00:11:39,040 --> 00:11:43,360
Okay, all right, so, and then in a commodity economy,

