00:13:17,720 --> 00:13:19,800
You spend a constant fraction of your income on X,

348
00:13:19,800 --> 00:13:21,360
a constant fraction of it on Y.

349
00:13:22,440 --> 00:13:24,640
All right, now so far, this probably looks really simple,

