363
00:14:05,400 --> 00:14:09,280
which is that the price of X over the price of Y

364
00:14:09,280 --> 00:14:14,280
will be equal to A over B times Y bar over X bar.

365
00:14:15,400 --> 00:14:18,600
All right, and that is the general equilibrium result.

