00:15:08,640 --> 00:15:10,840
So that's how we know that,

383
00:15:11,760 --> 00:15:14,960
that in equilibrium, everyone is going to consume

384
00:15:14,960 --> 00:15:17,040
their initial endowments of X and Y,

385
00:15:17,040 --> 00:15:19,680
and then this is the price that convinces people,

386
00:15:19,680 --> 00:15:22,440
that persuades them that is just what I want to do.

